  "delta_reasoning": "Full-corpus freeze audit confirms the original and complete EO13138 actor text are byte-identical as dossier text to those already read, and all 15 clause texts/offsets are unchanged. The new dossier adds alternate extracted-text term records with identical support-condition and September 30, 1998 sunset wording, changes source paths/metadata, changes actor variant IDs and machine scope to partial, and records 101 excluded generic references. Reading EO13138 section 3(e) resolves the machine partial label: it names EO13050 without section limitation, while section 3(c) expressly limits a different order to sections. Thus EO13050 is formally revoked in full on September 30, 1999 by section 9. That later cleanup cannot displace section 4(b)’s earlier Board termination on September 30, 1998. Section 1 continuances in EO13138 do not include this Board; no extension or earlier ending is affirmatively identified. All establishment, advisory, coordination, administrative, travel and FACA functions depend on the Board; accrued general-law reimbursements do not continue Board authority. Original/source page-check flags remain false; no official image inspection is represented. New missing/conflicts/current-law leads remain empty; machine search entries are unchanged, so their bounded-search adequacy and US Code October 9 coverage limitation are retained. All conflicts/metadata discrepancies are addressed before retaining the search IDs.",
